{"id":"9aaf86d4a85dccd7","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-absoluteness-constructible.md","title":"Constructibility Absoluteness","display":"thm-absoluteness-constructible — Constructibility Absoluteness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-absoluteness-constructible","aliases":["58-thm-absoluteness-constructible"],"display":"thm-absoluteness-constructible — Constructibility Absoluteness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-absoluteness-constructible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-absoluteness-constructible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-absoluteness-constructible — Constructibility Absoluteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md\">../batch16/58-df-constructible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,a,\\varphi\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,a,\\varphi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\Sigma_1(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (the existential-bounded formula class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic satisfaction relation for the set structures carried by constructible levels</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}constructible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\n\\land a\\in L_\\alpha\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\to\n\\left[\n(L_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(L_\\alpha\\times L_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[a]\n\\to\n(L_\\beta,\\in\\cap(L_\\beta\\times L_\\beta))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[a]\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}constructible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\n\\land a\\in L_\\alpha\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\to\n\\left[\n(L_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(L_\\alpha\\times L_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[a]\n\\to\n(L_\\beta,\\in\\cap(L_\\beta\\times L_\\beta))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[a]\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> formulas are upward absolute between the transitive levels <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\\subseteq L_\\beta\">\\(L_\\alpha\\subseteq L_\\beta\\)</span> containing their parameters.</li>\n<li>This is fundamental for independence proofs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,a,\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}constructible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\n\\land a\\in L_\\alpha\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\to\n\\left[\n(L_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(L_\\alpha\\times L_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[a]\n\\to\n(L_\\beta,\\in\\cap(L_\\beta\\times L_\\beta))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[a]\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha\\subseteq L_\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1453,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4018","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-absoluteness-constructible.md|58-thm-absoluteness-constructible]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3743f726a3653802","65418b505fc53093","5582a281f15a33c2","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}